ly ONLY in valid JSON matching this schema:\n```json\n{{\n  \"module_3_quality_style_safety\": {{\n    \"note_structure_organization_score\": <int 1-5>,\n    \"safety_risk_tier_score\": <int 1-4>,\n    \"overall_key_findings\": \"<string>\"\n  }}\n}}\n```\n"""
